  "duration_seconds": 75.6,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C01",
      "text": "二手车行的老板只肯给五万五。我翻开保养记录，三年，四万二千公里，无事故，行情六万二。你压我七千，是当我不懂行？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "9d0f5b061b9ce7bedafa3c715f5a20665bf39b23652ce3234832a1cba37cd27c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.086208333333333,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 273,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ea323ea09713feaa9136153157c1e912306c68c5d2bac863cc5a47520179e2bc",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "sample_count": 436138
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C02",
      "text": "他干笑，改口六万。我说，成交，签字。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ae47211dd2ab3d105fdb3d9ff0cb479ffb7fc9be8539e67ff9c2a9235b660c0c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.472125,
      "start_frame": 276,
      "end_frame": 381,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e972b405ca7186e1661b51f806f6fe0c62621c9c08ce2afb951fc69ef25ada02",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "sample_count": 166662
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C03",
      "text": "傍晚，七十八万借款到账。存款加借款，再加卖车的钱，一共一百二十五万二千。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "10298170430749b46b308cdd14212829b6537d66806bc19b7a7b0a2343b4a193",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.397125,
      "start_frame": 384,
      "end_frame": 576,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ce9cd03b40314137e04b6c08072b10a9e0cf909b392f916ea13c302095733d5f",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "sample_count": 307062
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C04",
      "text": "晚上是家庭聚餐。表叔放下筷子，问我，借这么多钱，到底干什么。我说，囤货。满桌人都笑了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "df01d178419a0523eff6481d7881cb27a5b94ddc3581be5b7fa5fbe7d6b2d4d1",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.5145625,
      "start_frame": 579,
      "end_frame": 805,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "30865475c4584918df5d24a698f2fe5e9ef3c1970992fd6117e459bb268f3977",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "sample_count": 360699
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C05",
      "text": "表叔拍着桌子说，三个月后你要是睡桥洞，别来找我。我夹了一筷子菜说，不会，我家有空调。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f03bd91511984316f7406b43047630faf70dbccabaa8bb1b0a0904d31b3cfb59",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.734104166666667,
      "start_frame": 808,
      "end_frame": 1011,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f4750c74f424272f05eae0649ff43633a575f3ef5c389afefc9935cee0491751",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.788781,
      "sample_count": 323237
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C06",
      "text": "出门时，又碰见马主任。他搂着新来的主管，笑我，失业的人，最容易走歪路。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "27db50815373d9909ed4cf82b3002b0582835fe034a4c313a266843d002287d3",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.7783125,
      "start_frame": 1014,
      "end_frame": 1188,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "da83c051d231c1fbfb20cbfb209640bf5e79d28d5426ede71a39a311ab9d2935",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 277359
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C07",
      "text": "我点点头说，马主任，保重。以后，可能见不到了。他在背后骂我疯了，我没回头。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e3eaed72625d59c63949dd5b85c5a3d1f0a0439b5be4299d488b3767a6198b80",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.761666666666667,
      "start_frame": 1191,
      "end_frame": 1394,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "054e438845aabac5d18773bf493f440eed69ba1397373747463cb72e2498b1b5",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "sample_count": 324560
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C08",
      "text": "第二天下午，货到了。八辆厢式货车，一直排到小区门口。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "78726a00d31e4793026d9cf56abedd82f2d1f30d133a41fdd871415efd010d14",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.211458333333334,
      "start_frame": 1397,
      "end_frame": 1524,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "151ed04f754df6f91a196f50f636b068602ab13dc8df75ee0dbed482207b27a0",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "sample_count": 202150
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C09",
      "text": "王大富拎着鸟笼来看热闹，问我，你这是要开批发部啊？我说，王哥，小点声，货不经吓。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ff3a045fbfda021045edc74534be64e4b32c2fe37ec16f99c888ab338ae45f06",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.524375,
      "start_frame": 1527,
      "end_frame": 1723,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "2a98ad68bd861253674f6fb0e961f81286cce2e1d67153809132d8a3fd185cc6",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.486906,
      "sample_count": 313170
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C10",
      "text": "天黑以后，我一趟一趟，把货推进卧室门里。水，粮，罐头，一箱接一箱，空厅被塞得越来越满。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c59000aee13009345c03c6f8988029f796974ae86f323ed8ef028673945d024c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.977875,
      "start_frame": 1726,
      "end_frame": 1966,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "cfdcdd49d02a20830684413afdc246b9b09c0a439e0f116b2e5a27e7348cf536",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "sample_count": 382938
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C11",
      "text": "六车货进去，系统提示，屋内容量，百分之九十八。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "501236451a1e9eeaada8ab301dbdaf3bda2e71aec10296072f97e64c0ee00806",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.6045833333333333,
      "start_frame": 1969,
      "end_frame": 2078,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f7e9a3a9719094497f00097fc04787eda22590b7cf442e6b3654df8775e3ebe2",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.690438,
      "sample_count": 173020
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP003-C12",
      "text": "我走到窗边，路边还停着两辆满载的货车。我喘着气，自言自语。我好像，订多了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/speed1p3/EP003-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0099d8b08cd3cae83c6bb9947b32a2d8247b8a21535394f503639c18bf4178c4",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.2160625,
      "start_frame": 2081,
      "end_frame": 2268,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP003/audio/EP003-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "df0da456e2e1ca6ad6d94aab34910a36c0e966ef7031d084b8206e173a62ef0b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "sample_count": 298371
    }
  ],
